---
description: "Commit message conventions (Conventional Commits)."
globs: ""
alwaysApply: true
---

Commit message rules:
- Format: `<type>[optional scope]: <description>`
- Types: feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test
- Subject line:
  - imperative mood
  - no trailing period
- Scope optional but recommended (example: `feat(accounts): add account list screen`)
- Body optional; explain what/why, not how.
